Depends on your level and the difficulty rating of the monster you're 
sacrificing. What's your level and what are you #offering?

Some general tips: don't #offer corpses of your own race as a non-
chaotic, don't #offer former pets, don't #offer coaligned unicorns, and 
don't #offer any unicorn on its own altar. (That last one will decrease 
your anger if the unicorn and altar are cross-aligned to you, but has 
other unpleasant side effects. Ditto with #offering former pets at a 
cross-aligned altar.)


